abstract: >-
  The Videha Digital Research Archive is a source-controlled digital humanities
  research environment for the connected histories, genealogy, literature,
  philosophy, places, texts and chronology of Mithila, Vajji and Anga across
  India and Nepal. It is a research venture of Videha — First Maithili
  Fortnightly eJournal, ISSN 2229-547X, https://www.videha.co.in/, with GitHub
  mirror https://videha-ejournal.github.io/videha/. Its publication layer
  provides permanent record URLs, citation exports, structured metadata,
  versioned datasets and checksum-based verification. Repository-authored
  software code is separately licensed under MIT; see RIGHTS.md for the full
  rights matrix.
